    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d16">

                <pb facs="0070" n="12" sameAs="frus:frus1866p3/pg12"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr. Campbell</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 4.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State, <hi
                                    rendition="#italic">Washington</hi>,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1866-11-23"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >November</hi> 23, 1866.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I give you a copy of a despatch<anchor
                        n="*" xml:id="d16-f1"/> which has just been received from Mr. Bigelow, from
                    which you will learn, as we have learned with surprise, that the French
                    government has postponed its stipulated withdrawal of the detachment from Mexico
                    in November, with the purpose, as is avowed, of withdrawing the whole of the
                    forces at once some time next spring. I give you also a copy of my reply*
                    thereto, announcing that this resolution of the French government is
                    unsatisfactory to the President. The same paper will inform you that the
                    President does not think it necessary or advisable to modify your instructions.
                    We are not without confidence in anticipating a satisfactory resolution upon the
                    subject from France.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lewis</hi> D. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Campbell,</hi> Esq., <hi rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c.,
                            &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d16-f1" n="*" xml:id="d16-f1-content">
                <p>For enclosure see Mr. Bigelow’s despatch No. 384, and the department’s reply
                    thereto, No. 550.</p>
            </note>
